@startuml Mission Supervisor State Machine
!theme cerulean

title MissionSupervisor Global State Machine (5 Drones)

[*] --> IDLE : System startup

IDLE --> READY : All drones\nreport ready states
IDLE --> READY : Auto-start\nafter 15 seconds
IDLE --> IDLE : Waiting for drones...

READY --> TAKEOFF_WINDOW_A : Immediate transition

TAKEOFF_WINDOW_A --> TAKEOFF_WINDOW_B : Window A timeout (30s)\nor all group A staged
TAKEOFF_WINDOW_A --> TAKEOFF_WINDOW_A : Managing window A...

TAKEOFF_WINDOW_B --> RUNNING : Window B timeout (30s)\nor all group B staged
TAKEOFF_WINDOW_B --> TAKEOFF_WINDOW_B : Managing window B...

RUNNING --> RETURN_AND_LAND : Mission complete
RUNNING --> ABORT : Emergency detected
RUNNING --> RUNNING : Mission active...

RETURN_AND_LAND --> COMPLETE : All drones landed
RETURN_AND_LAND --> RETURN_AND_LAND : Landing drones...

COMPLETE --> [*] : Mission finished

' Abort transitions
RUNNING --> ABORT : Any drone in EMERGENCY

note right of IDLE
    Waits for all expected drones
    (robot, robot2..robot5)
    Auto-starts after 15s
end note

note right of READY
    All drones detected
    Immediate transition
    to takeoff
end note

note right of TAKEOFF_WINDOW_A : **Group A**
    robot, robot2
    30-second window
    Advances early if
    all drones staged
end note

note right of TAKEOFF_WINDOW_B : **Group B**
    robot3, robot4, robot5
    30-second window
    Advances early if
    all drones staged
end note

note right of RUNNING
    Exploration phase
    Monitors for emergencies
    (any drone EMERGENCY -> ABORT)
end note

note right of RETURN_AND_LAND
    Mission ending
    Command all drones home
end note

note right of COMPLETE
    All drones safely landed
    Mission successful
end note

note right of ABORT
    Mission failed
    Triggered by drone
    EMERGENCY state
end note

@enduml
